  "approach": "Teach the tens and how numbers combine (veinti- as one word, treinta y ... as three words), the accents of veintidós, veintitrés and veintiséis, veintiún before a noun and cien for 100, then practice with ages and prices.",
  "coverage": [
    "21-29 are one word: veintiuno, veintidós, veintitrés ... veintinueve",
    "veintidós, veintitrés and veintiséis have written accents",
    "Tens: treinta, cuarenta, cincuenta, sesenta, setenta, ochenta, noventa",
    "From 31: tens + y + units, three words: treinta y uno, cuarenta y cinco, noventa y nueve",
    "100 = cien",
    "Before a masculine noun uno shortens: veintiún años, treinta y un años; una before a feminine noun",
    "Keep apart: sesenta (60) and setenta (70)"
  ],
